WEBVTT

00:07:00.958 --> 00:07:02.918
Less than two weeks later,

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:07.006
nearly 250 members
of the SOLA community,

00:07:07.047 --> 00:07:10.759
students, staff and family members,

00:07:10.801 --> 00:07:14.472
were out of Afghanistan and safe
in the nation of Rwanda.

00:07:15.681 --> 00:07:21.729
(Applause)

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:23.147
I will say this again.

00:07:24.899 --> 00:07:29.278
When you face the uncertainty
of what might be,

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:32.490
you can turn it into
the certainty of what will be.